{"ticker":{"symbol":"032280.KQ","name":"삼일","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1336.0,"change_pct":0.0,"market_cap":19731765248.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.029940119760479042,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":1510.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Trucking","country":"South Korea","city":"Pohang","employees":null,"website":"https://www.samil31.co.kr","business_summary":"Samil Co.Ltd. engages in the terminal business in South Korea. It offers land transportation services comprising transportation of iron products, steel, and general and heavy cargo; and container shipping, warehouse storage, and logistics information services. The company also provides port unloading, storage, and transportation and delivery; and leases berths and yards. In addition, it offers logistics storage services; manages and rents office buildings; and operates gas stations. The company was formerly known as Samil Transportation Limited Partnership and changed its name to Samil Co.,Ltd. in 1984. Samil Co.Ltd. was founded in 1965 and is headquartered in Pohang, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"삼일(주) 한국에서 터미널 사업을 하고 있습니다. 철제품, 철강, 일반화물, 중량화물 운송으로 구성된 육상운송 서비스를 제공합니다. 컨테이너 운송, 창고 보관, 물류 정보 서비스 등을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 항구 하역, 보관, 운송 및 배달 서비스를 제공합니다. 그리고 정박지와 마당을 임대합니다. 또한 물류 보관 서비스도 제공합니다. 사무실 건물을 관리하고 임대합니다. 주유소를 운영하고 있습니다. 삼일교통합자회사로 사명을 변경하고 삼일주식회사로 사명을 변경하였습니다. 1984년. 삼일주식회사 1965년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 포항에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"육상운송","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":91979315850.0,"operating_income":1796436160.0,"net_income":1232107740.0,"eps":79.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":99668556010.0,"operating_income":1721681350.0,"net_income":2828019090.0,"eps":182.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":105109049370.0,"operating_income":2474034340.0,"net_income":1236765450.0,"eps":80.0},{"period":